sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant X as New fact arrives<br/>(Midtrans replaced Stripe)
    participant G as Curation gate<br/>(turn end)
    participant DB as Notes store
    participant H as Version history<br/>(core .md writes)

    X->>G: extracted at turn end
    G->>DB: dedupe search finds the Stripe note
    G->>DB: NEW row - Midtrans, supersedes=[Stripe],<br/>old note and evidence preserved
    Note over DB: nothing overwritten - current-state reads latest,<br/>what-changed reads both

    alt new fact contradicts a core .md line
        G->>H: never overwrites the free zone -<br/>conflict flag to the morning report
    else a writer modifies a core .md
        X->>H: new version-history row - old doc preserved,<br/>origin AGENT or HUMAN, revertable
    end
